WEBVTT

00:04:29.397 --> 00:04:30.697
innovative and disruptive,

00:04:31.197 --> 00:04:35.730
that risk and uncertainty is at
its maximum when you start out

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:37.863
and you don't know if it's going to work.

00:04:37.897 --> 00:04:41.330
So your task is not to build something
to build a product.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:46.897
Your task is to decrease the risk of
building something nobody cares about.

00:04:46.897 --> 00:04:49.963
So how do you do this? You
get out of the building

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:55.663
and use this customer development process
by Steve Blank and talk to customers.

00:04:55.663 --> 00:04:58.163
And probably they say, you
don't understand me,

00:04:58.163 --> 00:05:01.430
but it's OK because you feel
cheaply and quickly.